    <div class="content">
        <h1 id="introduction">Introduction</h1>
<p>API REST du système de suivi de travail. Hiérarchie : Projet → Activité → Tâche.</p>
<aside>
    <strong>Base URL</strong>: <code>http://127.0.0.1:8000</code>
</aside>
<p>Cette documentation couvre tous les endpoints de l'API.</p>
<aside>Tous les endpoints (sauf login/register) requièrent un token Bearer Sanctum.
Obtenez-le via <code>POST /api/auth/login</code>.</aside>

        <h1 id="authenticating-requests">Authenticating requests</h1>
<p>To authenticate requests, include an <strong><code>Authorization</code></strong> header with the value <strong><code>"Bearer {VOTRE_TOKEN_SANCTUM}"</code></strong>.</p>
<p>All authenticated endpoints are marked with a <code>requires authentication</code> badge in the documentation below.</p>
<p>Obtenez votre token via <code>POST /api/auth/login</code>. Passez-le comme <code>Authorization: Bearer {token}</code>.</p>

        <h1 id="divers">Divers</h1>

    

                                <h2 id="divers-POSTapi-auth-register">POST api/auth/register</h2>

<p>
<small class="badge badge-darkred">requires authentication</small>
</p>



<span id="example-requests-POSTapi-auth-register">
<blockquote>Example request:</blockquote>


<div class="bash-example">
    <pre><code class="language-bash">curl --request POST \
    "http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/auth/register" \
    --header "Authorization: Bearer {VOTRE_TOKEN_SANCTUM}" \
    --header "Content-Type: application/json" \
    --header "Accept: application/json" \
    --data "{
    \"prenom\": \"b\",
    \"nom\": \"n\",
    \"email\": \"ashly64@example.com\",
    \"password\": \"architecto\",
    \"role\": \"admin\"
}"
</code></pre></div>


<div class="javascript-example">
    <pre><code class="language-javascript">const url = new URL(
    "http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/auth/register"
);

const headers = {
    "Authorization": "Bearer {VOTRE_TOKEN_SANCTUM}",
    "Content-Type": "application/json",
    "Accept": "application/json",
};

let body = {
    "prenom": "b",
    "nom": "n",
    "email": "ashly64@example.com",
    "password": "architecto",
    "role": "admin"
};

fetch(url, {
    method: "POST",
    headers,
    body: JSON.stringify(body),
}).then(response =&gt; response.json());</code></pre></div>


<div class="php-example">
    <pre><code class="language-php">$client = new \GuzzleHttp\Client();
$url = 'http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/auth/register';
$response = $client-&gt;post(
    $url,
    [
        'headers' =&gt; [
            'Authorization' =&gt; 'Bearer {VOTRE_TOKEN_SANCTUM}',
            'Content-Type' =&gt; 'application/json',
            'Accept' =&gt; 'application/json',
        ],
        'json' =&gt; [
            'prenom' =&gt; 'b',
            'nom' =&gt; 'n',
            'email' =&gt; 'ashly64@example.com',
            'password' =&gt; 'architecto',
            'role' =&gt; 'admin',
        ],
    ]
);
$body = $response-&gt;getBody();
print_r(json_decode((string) $body));</code></pre></div>

</span>

<span id="example-responses-POSTapi-auth-register">
</span>
<span id="execution-results-POSTapi-auth-register" hidden>
