                    <h2 id="divers-GETapi-evaluations-personnel--user_id--historique">Task 9: 4-section paginated history for the agent sheet page.</h2>

<p>
<small class="badge badge-darkred">requires authentication</small>
</p>

<p>Endpoint: GET /api/evaluations/personnel/{user}/historique</p>
<p>Query params:</p>
<ul>
<li>section: 'directed_tasks' | 'directed_subtasks' | 'assignee_tasks' | 'assignee_subtasks'</li>
<li>start, end: ISO date Y-m-d window (defaults: last 30 days)</li>
<li>statut: optional filter on tache.statut / sous_tache.statut</li>
